{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the <i>Prince of Persia</i> and <i>Mirror's Edge</i> series, traverse brutalist landscapes in this slice of life action-adventure game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910170/extras/a50c67fda8ba953b5e36b9fbaf037965.poster.avif?t=1758632669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910170/extras/a50c67fda8ba953b5e36b9fbaf037965.webm?t=1758632669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910170/extras/a50c67fda8ba953b5e36b9fbaf037965.mp4?t=1758632669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through Chapter 1 - (8 total in the full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against an epic colossal Boss Fight - (8 total in the full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 fully voiced story segments - (+30 in the full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full parkour movement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all system is available, such as the selfie and other interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beginning\u00a0of the game (Prologue)  is not available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one enemy type is available</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910170/extras/c7e2d2fa7d61fdc70443d2bee856b34e.poster.avif?t=1758632669\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910170/extras/c7e2d2fa7d61fdc70443d2bee856b34e.webm?t=1758632669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910170/extras/c7e2d2fa7d61fdc70443d2bee856b34e.mp4?t=1758632669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour. Vibes. Megastructure. Over-The-Top Action. Chainsaw Girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid acrobatic gameplay. Climb, run and slide your way around. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal fast-paced combat. You die easily, but you kill easily. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb massive heavy machines in epic boss fights. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse liminal spaces and parkour through brutalist landscapes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist atmospheric adventure with hardcore challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice of life story about a girl doing a routine job in a megastructure. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous pixelated modern low-poly graphics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles with physics oriented objects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banger Atmospheric DnB/Jungle OST by <i>Pizza Hotline</i>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910170/extras/fb33040eedeb0345dec25c7e619dac0e.poster.avif?t=1758632669\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910170/extras/fb33040eedeb0345dec25c7e619dac0e.webm?t=1758632669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910170/extras/fb3